{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:096a7dd6805c6acd","name":"K'thri Training","source":{"id":"source:reference-096a7dd6805c6acd","title":"K'thri Training","revision":20887,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:43:12Z","sha256":"79f1b7f42d58568d62c8ab1d3037508c3c96d595a948e2cb38589bd3f16c7c08","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20887","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=K%27thri%20Training&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-096a7dd6805c6acd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in the K'thri style of unarmed fighting, striking with flashy moves and incredible speed.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Once per round, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," against one enemy within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},", dealing your base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," damage with no bonus to the damage roll from your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," or Heroic Level.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," that misses the target, you deal half damage to the target. You must be wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," to gain the benefits of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["K'thri Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/K%27thri_Expertise"}]}," Talent, once per encounter when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"},", you can reroll one of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," rolls; however, you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. You must be wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," to gain this special benefit.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
